This story makes the products feel personal and touching. Customers can see that spending a little more money helps actual people, which can make them feel better about choosing the Fair Trade option.","p2Status":"Board Review: Approved!"}

{"officerName":"Josh Gillego","officerPeriod":"Period 2","p1Select":"coffee","p1Name":"☕ Coffee Beans (Maggie & Sivakami)","p1Analysis":"Coffee Farmer’s often live in poverty and they always lose or like have unfair wages whenever the C-Price drops. Switching to ethical products will provide fair wages and help improve a worker’s condition.","p1Nudge":"I will set it up besides expensive brands because I feel like it would attract customers because it’s a cheaper brand put beside expensive brands.  I feel like it would attract more customers because it’s a new product and many would probably be attracted to the new brand in the market.","p1Value":"This is John, he is a hardworking and determined coffee farmer from the rural side of Colombia. He has been doing this for almost 5 years now, helping his family with their coffee farming business. He is determined to do this to support and help his family pay their bills and expenses and to help with his sibling’s tuition fees. 

I feel like this personal story will make buyers feel good about paying a little more extra because they can help the coffee farmer support his family through buying the product harvested by the farmer.","p1Status":"Board Review: Approved!","p2Select":"chocolate","p2Name":"🍫 Chocolate/Cocoa Beans (Alex & Jack)","p2Analysis":"This product is normally made with the involvement of child labor and child slavery. Buying an ethical product will make a difference because it will gradually diminish child labor.","p2Nudge":"I will probably market this product by putting it on a shelf with different products to create comparison between different brands. I will display it on a shelf where it can easily be seen and noticed.","p2Value":"This is Jonah, he has been in this business for 10 years now to continue his late father’s business and legacy. He makes sure that he produces high quality cocoa beans sold in fair prices to support his family and to help his rural community.  Every cocoa beans and chocolate he produces reminds him of his father’s hard work to establish the business. 

It will make the buyers feel good about paying a little more extra because they are supporting someone who is hardworking and is aiming to help his community and his family with his income.","p2Status":"Board Review: Approved!"}
